# Generated outputs (regenerate with make sample / reproduce / validate / analyze / report).
# Ignore every file under results/ but keep descending into its directories, so the
# negations below can still re-include files.
results/**
!results/**/
# The aggregate report is small and is tracked, like results/report.toml of the paper folders.
!results/report.toml

# READMEs are always tracked. Mirror of the negations at the bottom of the root
# .gitignore; keep this block last.
!README.md
!**/README.md
